  retry. cpp samples exit cleanly on the same packages (the Core close/executor regression D-089 is fixed by cb62cb89f8).
- IMPORTANT: until today the node runner masked role SIGKILLs behind exit 0 (`9a0371fea7` made them failures), so this may be a
